This repository is a modified version of that work. The modifications are maintained at https://github.com/infinia-yzl/anny and add, among other things: a web viewer (viewer/), face shapes and their calibrated distribution (src/anny/faces), procedural hair (src/anny/hair), a pose library (src/anny/poses), soft-tissue correctives (src/anny/correctives), subdivision utilities (src/anny/utils/subdivision.py) and the corporis package (src/corporis), with the glTF export and the corporis command. The Python distribution is renamed from "anny" to "corporis". Each file keeps its original licence header. The git history records every change.

